h :answer/value "x=2\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7981/selection/c1e04e2b9659c2ba4138dff8561c22b702c41590134f69fafa68ca1ae4fd8ed5" :answer/id #uuid "d8ede4a5-db7e-5777-b50c-59d9fd9d6426" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=4\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7981/selection/6272cf4aae71c479340b1a07169424004630e7edfb3974311b8311b7f751adf3" :answer/id #uuid "4b48d4fa-3d7f-55f0-ae0e-b5d500f505ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,y=4\\operatorname{sec}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7981/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7c07c55d-64d2-53c5-9c32-5ca967243cd3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-7981/selection/c1e04e2b9659c2ba4138dff8561c22b702c41590134f69fafa68ca1ae4fd8ed5" :answer-field/choices ["q-7981/selection/a476c97af590c25af03e6a9f9fb749ad4b20ba7030e214005dfc6bf1e00d5a43" "q-7981/selection/d13ec76aee87ab5484ab0d4ae72ae27b2955159799a1225c369f2732db56cbd5" "q-7981/selection/a67b4bfadf4f39a9dac5377a4e300cc58c80326e193a6256d2e35796f3d6d117" "q-7981/selection/c1e04e2b9659c2ba4138dff8561c22b702c41590134f69fafa68ca1ae4fd8ed5" "q-7981/selection/6272cf4aae71c479340b1a07169424004630e7edfb3974311b8311b7f751adf3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-7981" :question/id #uuid "b4fa5363-8d28-588c-af19-d45889d261a3" :question/math-academy-id "q-7981" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077122/assets/cebf69993b4d699bde0e54584482951f4e7332f6a40477491ab294d167b9e5fc.png)\n\nFind the parametric equations of the hyperbola shown above given that its asymptotes are $y=\\pm 4x.$" :question/worked-solution "The parametric equations of a horizontal hyperbola centered at the origin with Cartesian equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=b\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are positive constants.\n\nThe vertices of the hyperbola occur at $(\\pm a,0).$ From the graph, we have that $(1,0)$ is a vertex of the hyperbola, so $a=1.$\n\nThe asymptotes of a horizontal hyperbola are $y=\\pm \\frac{b}{a}x.$ In our case, the asymptotes are $y=\\pm 4x,$ and so we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{b}{a} & =\\frac{4}{1} \\\\ \\frac{b}{1} & =\\frac{4}{1} \\\\ b & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\nx=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=4\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-7981/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "32fc8440-e872-50e4-ab98-5861d1c7310e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-7981"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-325924/field-1/ed480161c278cf263b7506697b7b27c19b2594926ada6527945331e6eb5a4b3b" :answer/id #uuid "2d9bd640-3962-50e6-9934-32fc14cbb391" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325924/field-1/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "b1915e45-4f4c-50dc-8534-a0d37627ec4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325924/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "37726d90-f059-5d1f-8aac-307bde69e296" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325924/field-1/ed480161c278cf263b7506697b7b27c19b2594926ada6527945331e6eb5a4b3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-325924/field-1/ed480161c278cf263b7506697b7b27c19b2594926ada6527945331e6eb5a4b3b" "q-325924/field-1/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325924/field-2/93debea6cad266feafc0ef80ffdeca243dc7ebd3db8f5ef4a4058084361faf1c" :answer/id #uuid "45b20f53-55e7-52eb-87a2-4655f7ddaa4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}\\tan(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325924/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "162b741f-24ca-5dc9-9d61-cb89935c5b3a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325924/field-2/93debea6cad266feafc0ef80ffdeca243dc7ebd3db8f5ef4a4058084361faf1c" :answer-field/choices ["q-325924/field-2/93debea6cad266feafc0ef80ffdeca243dc7ebd3db8f5ef4a4058084361faf1c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325924" :question/id #uuid "b45e30c8-2d4d-5afc-851a-933614ba138e" :question/math-academy-id "q-325924" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077122/assets/26abdce28d0596b6f7ec22b294a81ccbd24341ed0dcb27db02f0bb2e3b13ccd1.png)\n\nComplete the following parametric equations generating the hyperbola above in terms of the parameter $t,$ defined for $t\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi ]$ where $t\\ne \\pm \\frac{\\pi }{2},$ given that its asymptotes are $y=\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{8}}x.$\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=$\n{{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "The parametric equations of a horizontal hyperbola centered at the origin with Cartesian equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=b\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are positive constants.\n\nThe vertices of the hyperbola occur at $(\\pm a,0).$ From the graph, we have that $(\\sqrt{8},0)$ is a vertex of the hyperbola, so $a=\\sqrt{8}.$\n\nThe asymptotes of a horizontal hyperbola are $y=\\pm \\frac{b}{a}x.$ In our case, the asymptotes are $y=\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{8}}x,$ and so we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{b}{a} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{8}} \\\\ \\frac{b}{\\sqrt{8}} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{8}} \\\\ b & =\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\nx=\\sqrt{8}\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-325924/field-1" "q-325924/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "32fc8440-e872-50e4-ab98-5861d1c7310e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-325924"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-7979/selection/4e200d4f22df8cb68ce266a1873ff902715e0a11cb6bc297e99f08b371934cd8" :answer/id #uuid "37ba290b-1fb7-50e0-a4f0-8063a348fb8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=2\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,y=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7979/selection/b0d902a9e5e965810e77bd5577c3937ca8b72ccd5e64d9a6b6f734cd3413227e" :answer/id #uuid "d6a4a4c6-73ac-5df2-88db-7d0b2e9b91d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,y=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7979/selection/63480ceb1882d5bfb5753f044c7340eb55a3163de2259641878e5c182b0be3de" :answer/id #uuid "2270c56f-700e-5aef-ac8a-4b5cdacad400" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7979/selection/d13ec76aee87ab5484ab0d4ae72ae27b2955159799a1225c369f2732db56cbd5" :answer/id #uuid "0198b689-116b-5214-bd55-d1bbd1ea4b7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=2\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7979/selection/a67b4bfadf4f39a9dac5377a4e300cc58c80326e193a6256d2e35796f3d6d117" :answer/id #uuid "0a55ddc7-8ed1-56b3-b4d7-f82b46ec4dfd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=2\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\operatorname{tan}⁡t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7979/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "31a5318a-fadd-5fb4-ae35-a51222b3e5ad" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/corr